      "content": "idk if there are even triggers anymore. it just feels like who i am. like the relapse is just the default and the \"good\" version of me is just a lie i tell myself. it's just exhausting to wake up every day and have to fight a version of myself that i know i'm gonna lose to eventually. it's like a losing battle.",
